# This repo: `wwn-containers`

Machines kind **`container`** (OCI pull + run). Not VMs-as-product (see
`wwn-vms`), not Wasm Runtime packages, not Desktop, not Swinging Bridge.

## Mode A vs Mode B (design both)

| | Mode A (store) | Mode B |
|---|---|---|
| iOS / iPadOS / visionOS | container-in-VM on **jitless** VM engine | container-in-VM **+ JIT** (Mode B IPA) |
| macOS | Apple Containerization / planned native path | Privileged paths outside store-shaped builds |
| Android | Play-safe | Root/privileged outside Play |

- **Never** ship Mode B/JIT container engines in App Store / Play binaries.
- Do **not** conflate OCI images with `repo.wawona.io/wasm` `.wasm` packages.
- tvOS / watchOS: container kinds **forbidden**.
- Respect in-flight Apple Container work — do not casually rewrite that path.

Canonical: `Wawona/docs/containers-mode-a-b.md`, `mode-a-b.md`, `wawona-product-map`.
